WEBVTT

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.820
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.820
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.790
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.790
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.870
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.870
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.070
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.070
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.650
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.480
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.480
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.140
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.140
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.620
especially now…

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.620
ima koso

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.420
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.420
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:17.310
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:17.310
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:21.520
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:21.520
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.070
forever

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.070
itsudemo

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.290
The things which a heartbroken man says:

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:56.220
“If you don’t show women
something concrete,

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.390
you’ll be an unhappy person and won’t even be acknowledged by them.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:03.740
If things continue under those circumstances, soon it’ll be ‘Okay, farewell.’”

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:07.950
Something concrete…

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.900
Wow!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.540
Like, for example,

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.620
shouting “I love you”,

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:14.140
I LOVE YOU!

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:15.620
I LOVE YOU!!!

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.620
saying “I adore you” and kissing;

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.120
or giving them a present as proof that you treasure them.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.840
Or possibly…

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.820
a trip.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:33.240
Say,

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.240
this might be a bit sudden, but next Sund--

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:46.190
What? Did you eat my <i>tarte aux fraises</i>?!

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:47.690
But…

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:53.490
Ar-Aren’t you two always saying that you like those Mont-Blanc?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.640
But…

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.660
It looked so delicious.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.440
I can’t believe you guys!

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.640
Wanna eat the Mont-Blanc?

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.500
Wanna eat it?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.540
You guys, sit down there for a second.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.540
We’re sitting.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.090
Okay then!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.140
Stop harmonizing on every one of those lines!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.680
Aren’t you tired of doing that?!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.640
Listen!

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.180
The <i>tarte aux fraises</i> you just ate

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:29.440
was the motivation I needed to support me during work all throughout the day.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.720
Work, you say…

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.440
There aren’t any jobs anyway.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.610
None at all.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.590
W-Well that…

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.840
None at all!

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.440
Listen!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:49.690
“Even if you’re on standby mode, you’ll still consume some energy.”

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:52.420
Denko-chan is Tokyo Electric Power Company’s energy conservation mascot and represents an average electricity consumer.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.490
That’s what Denko-chan said!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.740
Be kind to the planet.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:55.510
Ah!

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.340
Amazing, amazing!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:14.890
Rentarou,

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.790
if you ever stopped being a detective, you could go into show business.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:17.540
Show business…

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.140
Idiots!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.190
That tune…

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:24.910
who’s it by?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.840
Daisy Fitzgerald.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.640
Daisy Fitzgerald…

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:40.740
Hm?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:43.890
Say…

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.390
This coming Sunday…

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.450
Shall the three of us go to the hot springs…?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:11.690
Sometimes,

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.940
Sara and Soujyu vanish into thin air like this,

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.820
completely cutting off all communication.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.610
Usually it’s only for two or three days.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.390
But this time,

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:25.740
it’s already been a week.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.840
Rentarou!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:45.540
Detective-san?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:46.760
Detective-san?

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:48.240
Umm…

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.470
Detective-san?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.590
My long-awaited work…

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:00.940
was to search for a dog.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.110
It had run away from the show window that they had forgotten to lock.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:05.690
A Maltese puppy.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.140
A week had already passed since it ran away.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:14.780
The health center and the neighborhood veterinary clinic have been notified.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.440
But still, no one had contacted them.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.990
Somehow, they wanted me to go look for it.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.190
The fee for which I accepted the case,

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:34.160
was more expensive than the price of the Maltese.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:40.590
Will he find it…

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:42.440
He will find it,

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.260
for sure.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.590
The important things in searching for a pet,

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.320
are know-how and personnel.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.590
Ah, you can’t reach it?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.840
The first thing to do is to make calls.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.690
The dog’s owner doesn’t think clearly,

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:02.790
and instead, tells me the worst case scenario.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.590
The posters,

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:18.690
will be hung up on main streets where people constantly come and go,

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:19.790
at bus stops,

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.840
at village garbage collection points.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.090
And, it anticipation of reports from children,

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:25.400
also on paths to schools.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.240
One was also given to the policeman in the police box.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.690
While patrolling,

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.290
there may be a chance that he’ll find it and report it in.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.310
Your call could not be completed as dialed.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:03.100
Your call could not be completed as--

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:06.990
Well,

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.090
it doesn’t matter.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.090
My lack of staff…

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.240
can’t be helped.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.390
Nah,

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.230
just take care of it yourself somehow.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.590
Excuse me then.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.240
Bye.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:46.140
Please.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.650
Umm…

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:54.890
What?

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:58.490
Do you have Daisy Fitzgerald?

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.040
Which one of Daisy’s?

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.040
Eh?

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.190
Ah…

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:05.890
Well…

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.390
Which tune was that again?

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:16.590
I see.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.540
If I catch sight of it, I’ll let you know.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.640
Thank you.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:21.690
Well then,

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:24.090
I’m going to put up some more posters in front of the station.

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:27.790
Hey,

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.480
where are those twin detective girls?

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:40.090
Come on, come on!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:46.890
I don’t know.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.340
I don’t know…

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:00.970
their reasons.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.980
It felt strange asking…

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:08.540
why they weren’t talking to me.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:11.990
To begin with,

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.240
the house they live in…

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:16.790
their home phone number…

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.520
I don’t know them at all.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.540
Today’s the fourth day…

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.690
since they disappeared.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.690
I still tirelessly continued…

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.700
the task of searching for the dog.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.890
Listen to this!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.440
You’re joking!

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.640
How uncool!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.240
I told you. You must be
mistaken or something.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.390
You can’t be serious.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.090
That can’t happen.

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:36.770
How lame.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.940
About their small disappearances…

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:51.940
when they first came into my house two years ago,

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:53.750
that was the first time.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:59.130
Why do we have to tell you the reason for every little thing that we do?!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.140
It’s common sense.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.770
Didn’t you say we could come and go whenever we pleased?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.540
That’s why I didn’t refuse your arrival.

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.890
If you were to suddenly take a break,

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.240
work arrangements would be disrupted.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.240
There isn’t even a teeny bit of work!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.240
If we can only come and go whenever it suits you,

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.690
then you obviously don’t care about us.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.090
He looks depressed.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.240
Yes,

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:31.190
this is the Futuba Detective Agency.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.040
What?

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.040
You saw it?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:38.290
…a cat?

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:39.890
No,

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.340
it’s not a cat.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.740
I-It’s a dog, a dog.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:43.640
Yes,

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:44.390
thanks.

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:45.190
Well then.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.540
Today is the third day
searching for the dog.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:53.390
So far,

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:54.840
there still are no clues.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:57.640
Also,

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.490
it’s been nine days,

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:00.840
since they left.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.600
HEY YOU!

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:57.540
There was no “I’m back!”

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:58.790
or “Welcome home!”

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.540
Together,

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.840
we started searching for the lost dog.

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.630
It was like nothing had happened.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.640
Hello auntie!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:11.190
Ah,

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.140
have you guys finally come back?

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:20.780
Here,

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.690
take these.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.170
Th-Thank you.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:30.590
You shouldn’t go around looking like those two abandoned you.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.600
Seeing you moping around, searching for that dog all by yourself;

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.230
it’s not at all pleasant,

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.060
and you wouldn’t be able to find it anyway.

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.560
Doggy?

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.160
Doggy?

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:20.990
Say…

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:22.840
What?

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.340
Err well,

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:24.940
umm…

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:29.740
“The croquettes from Sugisaku’s old lady are absolutely delicious,”

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.740
is what I was going to say.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.290
Yeah.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.500
Say, boss…

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.140
What is it?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.790
This may be a bit sudden, but…

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.440
Have you ever been on a trip with your wife?

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:58.340
Why are you asking that?

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.720
Err, well, it doesn’t matter.

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.690
A long time ago,

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.690
I took my overbearing wife
to the hot springs.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.790
It was only once though.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.240
Yeah.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:19.140
She really enjoyed herself there.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.140
Yeah.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:26.540
At that time, me and the wife already had a family for ten years, but

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:29.660
it was the first time
that we had gone there.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.240
Yeah.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:33.240
Well,

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:35.540
that’s all.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:36.940
Yeah.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.890
Thank you for having me.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:46.640
Yeah.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.090
In the end,

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.030
we didn’t find it today either.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:18:59.940
Yeah.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.090
Tomorrow, should we go and check over there by the river?

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.640
Yeah.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.640
Say…

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.040
Once we finish this job,

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.240
do you want to go to the hot springs or something?

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.390
Hot springs?

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.940
Err, well, I was thinking of a trip to somewhere…

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.140
Well, I guess anywhere is fine.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.540
It’s just fine like this!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.440
Huh?

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:29.540
If it was always just the three of us walking together like this,

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.990
that would be the best.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.440
Even if we become 20 years old…

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.440
Even if we become 30 years old…

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.410
Even if we become 40 years old…

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.270
Even if we become 50 years old…

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.050
Even if we become 60 years old…

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.890
Even if we become 70 years old…

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.990
Even if we become 80 years old…

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.440
Nonsense!

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:48.590
I work so hard

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:50.940
that I’m going to an early grave!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.740
There’s no way that I’d live to become an old geezer.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.490
Ah!

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.640
Rentarou is crying!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.640
Ah, it’s true!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.690
Nonsense!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:03.940
I’m not crying!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.640
Wait, Rentarou!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.990
Rentarou!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.040
Wait!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.940
Ah, what a cute doggy!

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:38.740
Ah.

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:42.590
A commemorative photo.

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:46.940
The sky from the time when we were really happy.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.240
The sky from when we were together for the first time.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.240
The clouds passed by.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.090
The sun set.

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:01.040
There’s no way that the same sky will be over us a second time.

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:03.790
But,

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.740
in that photo, it’ll always be there.

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.390
That’s why,

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:09.740
a commemorative photo.

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:13.690
Ah, is that so?

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:14.840
I am glad about that.

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:16.390
Thank you.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:17.590
We weren’t that helpful though.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:18.890
No,

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.740
thank you very much.

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:45.340
Say…

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:47.290
The next time,

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.890
we go missing…

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:52.410
Will you come and search for us?

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:25.810
We are here.

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:25.640
bokura wa koko ni iru

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:33.210
We will be here.

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:33.210
bokura ga koko ni aru

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:38.530
The slow time is

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:38.530
yuruyaka na jikan ga

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:45.460
flowing in this room.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:45.460
nagareteru kono heya de

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:49.060
Even if the summer days vanish,

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:49.060
natsu no hi ga kiete mo

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:53.120
the smiles that remain

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:53.120
nokoru egao tachi

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:00.000
are a chain of happiness up to this point.

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:00.000
kocchi made shiawase no rensa

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:05.840
Ah, the meaning of honesty,

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:05.840
aa sunaosa no imi

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:14.180
